15
00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:54.887
Ah.

16
00:00:55.056 --> 00:00:55.959
Ah.

17
00:00:55.959 --> 00:00:57.963
Nueve intestinos estofados con panza.

18
00:00:58.399 --> 00:00:59.252
Nueve barriga

19
00:00:59.586 --> 00:01:00.550
intestinos estofados.

20
